  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#x2018;Identification and scoping of potential Danish support to the GWSP and CIWA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the consultancy is, based on the priorities set forth in the Danish Strategy for Development Cooperation, to:
&#x2022;	Identify and assess scope and priorities of potential new Danish support to the GWSP
&#x2022;	Assess whether Denmark should re-engage as a partner to CIWA and if so identify key Danish priorities</narrative>
  </description>
